{"id": "185854", "name": "מצאו בסיס למרחב השורות ולמאפס של מטריצה A", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "get_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,1]))"}, {"name": "get_rand_rank_1_3_mat", "params": ["frmat1", "frmat2"], "body": "addcol(addcol(col(frmat1,1),matrix([0],[0],[0])),matrix([0],[0],[0])) . transpose(addcol(addcol(col(frmat2,1),matrix([0],[0],[0])),matrix([0],[0],[0])))"}, {"name": "get_rand_rank_2_3_mat", "params": ["frmat1", "frmat2"], "body": "addcol(addcol(col(frmat1,1),col(frmat1,2)),matrix([0],[0],[0])) . transpose(addcol(addcol(col(frmat2,1),col(frmat2,2)),matrix([0],[0],[0]) ))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המטריצה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A = {{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו בסיס למרחב השורות של המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Row(A)\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"f